/// Contract: `VG.Spec.ChaCha20.initContract`. The streaming state is opaque (`VG.Spec.ChaCha20.keyAt`, `VG.Spec.ChaCha20.restAt`). Constant time: only the pointers may affect timing, not the key or the nonce.
